            "review_title": "Review at Popeyes - Maximark Cong Hoa",
            "review_text": "Toan N\nMelbourne, Australia4201 contributions\n0\nThe need for spicy chicken has been satisfied at Popeye's\nFeb 2016 • Couples\nAs I will reiterate with prior reviews, I thought I had the best fried chicken ever. In Australia we don't have Popeye's, but KFC would be similar. To me, the chicken has more kick and spices to it, tastes better too. This experience was spontaneous and glad I went in, staff can speak English too, guess it's probably a requirement since being in a tourist area.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten February 24, 2016",
